**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

Unhandled errors can expose stack traces or crash the server.

**Fix:**
```javascript
// Centralized error handling
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err.stack);
  res.status(500).json({ 
    message: 'Internal Server Error',
